<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have moved troops into the Kataib Hezbollah stronghold of Jurf al-Sakhar and also into Jurf al-Nasr as Prime Minister Al-Zaidi orders an inquiry into oil smuggling and threatens force to enforce a militia withdrawal deadline. Kataib Hezbollah denies involvement in the smuggling probe, calling it a lie and accusing the government of yielding to external pressure. Jordan and Iraq have jointly blocked the Telegram messaging app citing national security concerns. Five people were arrested for impersonating a prosecutor. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/17/tankers-hit-in-strait-of-hormuz-as-drone-raises-alarm-at-iraq-gas-field?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE1iNmVhWG9MeTNkbFhMNGtWU3ZKbWxXbFhrRXlrUGhHcE5YZXE0YlFyNWo4ZmMxVVFzcDFmT09HWEZPUklJbC1ZN0JGTmMtNlE3S1liTkdlYVRXZ1RMd0ZHVWNkY1MzUG8xQ1dSS2F0alVRVjRib0Qw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTFBCWkhEN1czMXY0cFpKaV9Ed2NERjJSR0gzV2NhN1FnODlhZGZsSFZQY2p3ZFE3X0lka254NmpzU0Y5MFc4UlpXbWlBZGx2RWpEcWdBbWJhRHlkLWRlMjZjQmRiVUg3cUhMZnlkUTg0bU8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Responsible Statecraft&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUkFVX3lxTFAxcjhYVlpSUG1qY3dNWXV2bFhQYTN4elBZQ0FmdEpjMk1zaUJKbDdJUHEzbldKbm5WRHhmY1Y0QnEzbE52OGpIUUtNbmNzSFZ3ZXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Iran International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chosunbiz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxNcDdKakNBNllyVnZ4SFVaODdJZWF